(text "Power input.  J6 USB-C (power only: CC1/CC2 5.1k to GND = default USB 5 V)\nor J1 bench supply.  JP4 picks ONE source: 1-2 = USB, 2-3 = bench.\nNever connect both with the jumper set to one - the other is simply unused.\nSW2 power switch -> F1 0.5 A polyfuse -> Q1 reverse-polarity P-FET\n(drain to input, source to +5V, gate to GND via R17).  Q1 blocks a\nreversed bench supply.  C1 47uF bulk.  D9 power LED (R18 1k)." (at 45.72 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2acdc8de-ff9b-5c0b-8fc1-23a25ecc723b))
